{
  "$comment": "SUITE DE REGRESION — 5 casos sobre el portal de RRHH OrangeHRM. Escritos con el vocabulario que usaria un FD, sin mirar el DOM. El orden importa: CP02 va primero porque necesita sesion cerrada, CP01 abre la sesion y CP03-CP05 la reutilizan (el walker mantiene el contexto del navegador entre flujos).",
  "version": 1,
  "site_id": "orangehrm",
  "entry": "/web/index.php/auth/login",
  "base_url": "https://opensource-demo.orangehrmlive.com",
  "flows": [
    {
      "flow": "CP02-acceso-credenciales-invalidas",
      "criteria": [
        "RF-002"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "s1",
          "action": "fill",
          "hint": {
            "role": "textbox",
            "name": "Username"
          },
          "value": "usuario.inexistente"
        },
        {
          "id": "s2",
          "action": "fill",
          "hint": {
            "role": "textbox",
            "name": "Password"
          },
          "value": "clave-incorrecta",
          "secret": true
        },
        {
          "id": "s3",
          "action": "click",
          "hint": {
            "role": "button",
            "name": "Login"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "s4",
          "action": "expect_text",
          "value": "Invalid credentials"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "flow": "CP01-acceso-credenciales-validas",
      "criteria": [
        "RF-001"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "s1",
          "action": "fill",
          "hint": {
            "role": "textbox",
            "name": "Username"
          },
          "value": "$fixtures.credentials[0].username"
        },
        {
          "id": "s2",
          "action": "fill",
          "hint": {
            "role": "textbox",
            "name": "Password"
          },
          "value": "$fixtures.credentials[0].password",
          "secret": true
        },
        {
          "id": "s3",
          "action": "click",
          "hint": {
            "role": "button",
            "name": "Login"
          },
          "expect_transition": true,
          "screen": "dashboard"
        },
        {
          "id": "s4",
          "action": "expect_text",
          "value": "Dashboard"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "flow": "CP03-listado-de-empleados",
      "criteria": [
        "RF-010"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "s1",
          "action": "goto",
          "target": "/web/index.php/pim/viewEmployeeList",
          "screen": "pim-listado"
        },
        {
          "id": "s2",
          "action": "expect_text",
          "value": "Records Found"
        },
        {
          "id": "s3",
          "action": "expect_count",
          "hint": {
            "role": "row"
          },
          "operator": ">",
          "value": "1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "flow": "CP04-filtrado-por-nombre-de-empleado",
      "criteria": [
        "RF-011"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "s1",
          "action": "goto",
          "target": "/web/index.php/pim/viewEmployeeList",
          "screen": "pim-listado"
        },
        {
          "id": "s2",
          "action": "fill",
          "hint": {
            "label": "Nombre del empleado"
          },
          "value": "Odis"
        },
        {
          "id": "s3",
          "action": "click",
          "hint": {
            "role": "button",
            "name": "Search"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "s4",
          "action": "expect_text",
          "value": "Records Found"
        }
      ],
      "$nota": "El FD del cliente esta en ESPANOL y el producto es un COTS en INGLES. Es el caso corporativo mas comun en banca/seguros, y es el que dispara el rescate: la escalera determinista no puede puentear 'Nombre del empleado' a 'Employee Name' sin adivinar, y adivinar es lo unico que este componente no hace. El LLM lee el arbol de accesibilidad podado, devuelve el locator, y si la postcondicion se cumple el alias queda en memoria: ese rescate se paga UNA VEZ por cliente, no una vez por ejecucion."
    },
    {
      "flow": "CP05-consulta-datos-personales",
      "criteria": [
        "RF-020"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "s1",
          "action": "goto",
          "target": "/web/index.php/pim/viewMyDetails",
          "screen": "mis-datos"
        },
        {
          "id": "s2",
          "action": "expect_text",
          "value": "Personal Details"
        },
        {
          "id": "s3",
          "action": "expect_state",
          "hint": {
            "role": "textbox",
            "name": "First Name"
          },
          "value": "visible"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}